@Tabiji.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness probe
GET {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Readiness probe (checks the database)
GET {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Create a trip
POST {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rome & Amalfi",
  "destination": "Italy",
  "startsOn": "2027-04-01",
  "endsOn": "2027-04-14"
}

### Get a trip by id
GET {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document
GET {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
